  ["marine", "🐚 Marine fossils", "Most fossils come from the sea, where shells, teeth and skeletons were quickly buried in mud and sand. This section covers echinoderms (sea urchins, sand dollars, starfish, crinoids and blastoids), shark teeth, mollusks such as snails, clams and ammonites, and other ancient sea life."],
